  "data": {
    "summary": "During Normal moves, Fall Back moves and Advance moves, this unit’s models can pass through any model lacking TITANIC. They can also go horizontally across terrain sections up to 4″ high. Before the move, you may give MOBILE to every model in the moving unit for its duration. Afterward, roll a D6 if you chose MOBILE. A 1 leaves the unit Battle-shocked. MOBILE also permits horizontal passage through dense terrain. See Super-heavy Walker and Terrain and Movement.",
